{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2022-02-18 22:34:00', 'title': "SEABOURN TO PARTICIPATE IN CDC'S UPDATED PROGRAM FOR CRUISE SHIPS; PROVIDES UPDATES TO GUESTS", 'text': 'SEATTLE, FEB. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEABOURN , THE ULTRA-LUXURY OCEAN AND EXPEDITION CRUISE LINE, HAS CONFIRMED TODAY THAT IT WILL OPT IN TO THE U.S. CENTERS FOR DISEASE CONTROL AND PREVENTION (CDC) UPDATED PROGRAM FOR CRUISE SHIPS OPERATING IN U.S. WATERS. THE LINE WILL CONTINUE TO OPERATE VACCINATED CRUISES, WITH TWO KEY CHANGES TO ONBOARD PROTOCOLS FOR GUESTS EFFECTIVE MARCH 1: MASKS ON BOARD WILL BE RECOMMENDED BUT NOT REQUIRED.'}